  "title": {
   "en": "Zetsumetsukigushu Hanayome Shiitagerareta Hime desu ga Ouji-sama no Noroi wo Hodoite Shiawase ni narimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Zetsumetsukigushu Hanayome Shiitagerareta Hime desu ga Ouji-sama no Noroi wo Hodoite Shiawase ni narimasu"
   },
   {
    "ja": "絶滅危惧種 花嫁 虐げられた姫ですが王子様の呪いを解いて幸せになります"
   },
   {
    "en": "The True Value of the Throwaway Bride"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A shy bride who was called \"useless\" and a cursed, fluffy prince fall in love!\n\nThe Norstalt family were known for their superpowers. However, Elena was born with no power at all. Her mother adored her, but passed away when Elena was young. She was treated cruelly by her family as a \"useless girl\" and when she turned seventeen, she was ordered by her father to marry Yuri, the cursed second prince of Lodenium. The bride was supposed to be Vanessa, her younger sister who was blessed with fire power, but their father decided to offer Elena instead. When she reached the palace of Lodenium, she was told that prince won't come until the night of the Full Moon. It first bothered her, but people around her were all kind and gentle, and Elena started to enjoy living in the palace. Then she met a strange big wolf in the garden...\n\n(Source: Kadokawa, edited)"
  },
